    ns95:test_combined_kg.py dcterms:identifier "tests.codekg.unit.test_combined_kg" ;
        a slkg:Module ;
        rdfs:comment """``starlayer-kg.trig``: the whole KG in one TriG file that an agent loads with StarLayerDataset and queries.

The comparison tests are the point: queries read out of the graph and run with ``kg.query`` must give the answers
StarLayer's own query tool gives. Only StarLayer's classes are used here, never rdflib directly.""" ;
        rdfs:label "test_combined_kg" ;
        slkg:declares ns360:test_the_file_holds_every_layer, ns360:test_an_agent_can_read_a_query_from_the_graph_and_run_it, ns360:test_the_comparison_treats_renamed_blank_nodes_as_the_same, ns360:kg, ns360:test_every_query_in_the_graph_gives_the_answer_the_query_tool_gives, ns360:_dataset, ns360:test_the_comparison_notices_a_missing_extra_or_changed_graph ;
