``sqe:``, ``srl:`` and the encoder, so it cannot sit inside ``salg/``). ``salg`` imports it from there.""" ;
        rdfs:label "expr_families" ;
        slkg:filePath "packages/starlayer/starlayer/sparql/salg/expr_families.py" .
