    ns75:StarShaclSchema.__init__.param.shacl_graph a slkg:Parameter ;
        rdfs:comment "The SHACL shapes graph to validate against. Normalized once, here, rather than per-call: every method below reads this same object every time, so ``apply_rules()``'s own separate ``normalize_graph_inputs(self.shacl_graph, ...)`` call (for ``rule_set``/``_global_sparql_rule_triples`` - needs blank-node identity to match whatever ``self.validate()`` ends up using internally) gets the identical, already-normalized object back - no second, independent normalization that could silently diverge." ;
