        rdfs:comment "If ``shacl_graph`` declares ``owl:imports`` that aren't already locally satisfied (see ``has_import_locally()``) and no ``shapes_graph_loader`` was given, ``validate()`` raises ``ValueError`` by default rather than silently proceeding with a possibly incomplete shapes graph. Pass ``True`` to opt out explicitly - e.g. because the imports were already resolved into ``shacl_graph`` beforehand (``resolve_imports()`` doesn't strip the ``owl:imports`` triple once resolved, so its mere presence can't otherwise distinguish \"already handled\" from \"genuinely missing\")." ;
