GRAPH <https://github.com/hidden-graph/starlayer/blob/main/packages/starlayer/tests/shacl/integration/test_per_constraint_annotations.py> {
    ns97:test_per_constraint_annotations.py dcterms:identifier "tests.shacl.integration.test_per_constraint_annotations" ;
        a slkg:Module ;
        rdfs:comment """Per-constraint sh:severity/sh:deactivated via RDF-1.2 inline reification
annotation (SHACL 1.2 Core) - distinct from, and finer-grained than, a
shape's own sh:severity/sh:deactivated (already handled generically by
pySHACL for every constraint). Found via the W3C SHACL 1.2 test suite's
severity-003/deactivated-003 fixtures.""" ;
