        rdfs:comment "The whole-project pre-pass result from ``symbol_index.build_symbol_index()``, used to resolve call sites (``slkg:calls``) to their target function/method, including ones defined in other files. ``None`` (the default) degrades gracefully rather than raising - every call site simply resolves against an empty index, so no ``slkg:calls`` edges are emitted at all; every other extracted fact is unaffected. Pass the real index for a production extraction run (see ``build.py::refresh()``); omit it for a quick, single-file, call-graph-unaware extraction (e.g. in a test)." ;
