    ns348:competency_questions dcterms:identifier "starlayer.codekg.queries.competency_questions" ;
        a slkg:Function ;
        rdfs:comment """The questions the graph should answer (the ``slkg:CompetencyQuestion`` nodes), sorted by topic then text.

``status`` filters by ``"answerable"``, ``"roadmap"``, ``"curated"`` or ``"out-of-scope"``; ``unanswered=True``
