GRAPH <https://github.com/hidden-graph/starlayer/blob/main/packages/starlayer/tests/graph/unit/test_manchester_parser.py> {
    ns111:test_manchester_parser.py dcterms:identifier "tests.graph.unit.test_manchester_parser" ;
        a slkg:Module ;
        rdfs:comment """Unit tests for starlayer.graph.parsers.manchester_parser.

Grouped by construct: frames, each class-expression form, each Misc axiom,
and the constructs this parser deliberately doesn't support yet (must raise
ManchesterSyntaxError, not silently mis-parse). RDF-mapping correctness for
the bulk of these cases was cross-checked during development against the
real OWL API's ManchesterOWLSyntaxOntologyParser (an external, uncommitted
oracle - see the module docstring) via starlayer.graph.compare.isomorphic();
these tests assert the same shapes directly, with no external dependency.""" ;
        rdfs:label "test_manchester_parser" ;
        slkg:declares ns214:TestClassClauses, ns214:TestUnsupported, ns214:TestGraphIntegration, ns214:TestInlineAxiomAnnotations, ns214:TestPropertyClauses, ns214:TestFrames, ns214:TestDatatypesAndDataRanges, ns214:TestClassExpressions, ns214:restriction_for, ns214:TestIndividualClauses, ns214:parse, ns214:TestMiscAxioms, ns214:ex ;
        slkg:filePath "packages/starlayer/tests/graph/unit/test_manchester_parser.py" ;
        slkg:importsModule ns4:pytest, ns4:rdflib.namespace, ns4:rdflib .

