GRAPH <https://github.com/hidden-graph/starlayer/blob/main/packages/starlayer/tests/starontology/manchester_conformance/test_mc_coverage_matrix.py> {
    ns334:test_mc_coverage_matrix.py dcterms:identifier "tests.starontology.manchester_conformance.test_mc_coverage_matrix" ;
        a slkg:Module ;
        rdfs:comment """The coverage matrix: every W3C Manchester Syntax production must be exercised by the corpus.

This is the guard against "we never even listed that construct". A production with no case is a hole in
the suite itself, reported by name, before any question of whether the parser handles it.""" ;
        rdfs:label "test_mc_coverage_matrix" ;
