    ns281:parse_docstring.returns a slkg:ReturnValue ;
        rdfs:comment "A dict with three keys: ``\"summary\"`` (``str``, the prose before any recognized header), ``\"params\"`` (``dict[str, str]``, one entry per ``Args:`` parameter), and ``\"returns\"`` (``str | None``, the ``Returns:`` section's text, or ``None`` if there is no ``Returns:`` section). All default to empty/``None`` for a missing/empty ``raw``. Never raises - a docstring that doesn't clearly match the grammar is returned as pure summary text instead of causing a crash." ;
