GRAPH <https://github.com/hidden-graph/starlayer/blob/main/packages/starlayer/tests/starontology/unit/test_shipped_shapes_meta_validate.py> {
    ns265:test_shipped_shapes_meta_validate.py dcterms:identifier "tests.starontology.unit.test_shipped_shapes_meta_validate" ;
        a slkg:Module ;
        rdfs:comment """Every SHACL shapes graph StarLayer ships must itself be a well-formed
shapes graph, checked with the project's own meta-SHACL preflight.

``meta_shacl`` is off by default in ``validate()`` (a development-time check),
and internal validators such as ``srl_validate`` rely on the shipped shapes
being sound without re-checking them on every call. This test is that check,
run once in the fast tier instead.

The list is read from the registry, so a newly registered shapes graph is
covered automatically.""" ;
        rdfs:label "test_shipped_shapes_meta_validate" ;
        slkg:declares ns298:test_the_check_does_reject_a_malformed_shapes_graph, ns298:test_shipped_shapes_graph_passes_meta_shacl, ns298:test_the_registry_has_shapes_graphs_to_check ;
